WEBVTT

00:09:32.985 --> 00:09:37.740
Now I like to consider myself
a master at this Hi Level stuff.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:40.492
I mean, I am here for a reason, right?

00:09:40.492 --> 00:09:41.744
(Laughter)

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:46.832
But that doesn't mean
things always go my way.

00:09:46.874 --> 00:09:48.709
Even now,

00:09:48.751 --> 00:09:51.879
I just recently released
my sophomore album

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:55.299
"From a Birds Eye View"
that I spent two full years creating.

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:58.427
My debut album, "The Lost Boy,"

00:09:58.469 --> 00:10:02.181
was met with massive
critical acclaim and success,